ForgeProof is a project by Flying Cloud Technology (https://www.flyingcloudtech.com).
It is an open-source code provenance attestation platform that uses Ed25519
cryptographic signatures and SHA-256 hash chains to track AI-generated code
origin, geographic compliance, and multi-model audit trails.

